# Trivy Ignore List for Nexus Build
#
# To update this file, run: ./hack/sync-trivyignore.sh
# or: /fix-vulnerabilities (Step 0)

# ============================================================
# pkg:maven/commons-lang/commons-l
# ============================================================

# ============================================================
# pkg:maven/org.eclipse.jetty/jetty-http@9.4.58.v20250814
# ============================================================

# [High] Elasticsearch in Nexus is not externally exposed; endpoint/listener vulnerabilities are not applicable
CVE-2019-7611

# [High] Unauthenticated attacker can trigger OOM via malformed HTTP request; Nexus ES is not externally exposed, not affected
CVE-2023-31418

# [Medium] X-Pack ML stored XSS; Nexus does not enable ML, not affected
CVE-2018-3824

# [Medium] ES is not externally exposed; endpoint/listener and document/field-level permission attack surfaces do not exist
CVE-2019-7614

# [Medium] ES is not externally exposed; endpoint/network listener and document/field-level permission vulnerabilities are not applicable
CVE-2020-7019

# [Low] ES is not externally exposed; endpoint/listener and document/field-level permission vulnerabilities are not applicable
CVE-2020-7020

# [Medium] Requires audit logging enabled with emit_request_body configured; Nexus does not enable this, not affected
CVE-2020-7021

# [Medium] Requires suggester/profile API with DLS/FLS enabled; Nexus does not enable these, not affected
CVE-2021-22135

# [Medium] Involves DLS/FLS permission retention in cross-cluster search; Nexus does not provide cross-cluster search, not affected
CVE-2021-22137

# [Medium] Uncontrolled Grok parser recursion depth can cause DoS; Nexus does not integrate this component, not affected
CVE-2021-22144

# [Medium] Requires Watcher (X-Pack) enabled with search input logger set to DEBUG; image does not include/enable Watcher, not affected
CVE-2023-49921

# [Medium] Vulnerability affects improper private key encryption when elasticsearch-certutil generates CSR; Nexus ES is not externally accessible, not affected
CVE-2024-23444

# [Medium] Crafted ES SQL function execution can cause OOM; Nexus ES is not externally exposed, SQL plugin cannot be called externally, not affected
CVE-2024-43709

# [Medium] Resource exhaustion when using Mustache search templates; Nexus does not use this component, not affected
CVE-2024-52979

# ============================================================
# Jetty 9.4.58 (jetty-http)
# ============================================================

# [Medium] [False positive] The installed version's corresponding commit already includes the fix
CVE-2024-6763

# ============================================================
# pkg:maven/org.apache.shiro/shiro-core@1.13.2-alauda
# ============================================================

# [Low] Timing-attack brute force. Already backported in the AlaudaDevops/shiro 1.13.x-alauda fork (see Containerfile SHIRO_CORE_NEW_VERSION); Trivy still matches by version string < 2.1.0.
CVE-2026-23901

# [High] LDAP DN injection. Backported in AlaudaDevops/shiro 1.13.2-alauda fork
# (Rdn.escapeValue on principal in DefaultLdapRealm + ActiveDirectoryRealm).
# Upstream fix is only in 2.2.1+, which is unusable here due to OSGi range [1.13, 2.0).
CVE-2026-49268

# [Medium] Session fixation. Backported in AlaudaDevops/shiro 1.13.2-alauda fork
# (DefaultSecurityManager destroys existing session on successful login).
# Upstream fix only in 2.2.0+.
CVE-2026-43827

# ============================================================
# pkg:maven/org.apache.shiro/shiro-web@1.13.2-alauda
# ============================================================

# [Medium] Insecure session/rememberMe cookies over HTTPS. Backported in
# AlaudaDevops/shiro 1.13.2-alauda fork (default Secure flag on DefaultWebSessionManager
# and CookieRememberMeManager; SimpleCookie only emits Secure when request.isSecure()).
# Upstream fix only in 2.2.0+.
CVE-2026-43828

# ============================================================
# pkg:maven/org.jline/jline-remote-telnet@3.21.0-alauda
# ============================================================

# [High] Telnet NAWS DoS. Backported in AlaudaDevops/jline3 3.21.0-alauda fork
# (LARGEST_BELIEVABLE_WIDTH/HEIGHT=500 upper bound in setTerminalGeometry).
# Upstream fix only in 4.2.1+, unusable here due to Karaf OSGi range [3.21, 4).
# Nexus doesn't enable Karaf telnet — additional defense in depth.
CVE-2026-56741
GHSA-2r2c-cx56-8933

# [High] Telnet NEW-ENVIRON heap DoS. Backported in AlaudaDevops/jline3 3.21.0-alauda
# fork (NE_VAR_COUNT_MAX=100 guard in readNEVariables). Upstream fix only in 4.2.1+.
CVE-2026-56740
GHSA-47qp-hqvx-6r3f

